--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: Barks_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd6dc0bc22391654f8b00bd60b61b07f, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 2105433060097654784
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 328054419456
    m_Localized: You should NEVER disturb a meditating Glarexus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328100556800
    m_Localized: "I wonder if he\u2019s thinking about something... or just sleeping."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328100556801
    m_Localized: 'Glarexes are deeply spiritual creatures, just like humans. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328100556802
    m_Localized: Golomos tend to keep to themselves. They are the personification
      of an introvert.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751104
    m_Localized: "I wonder what\u2019s it thinking... if it\u2019s thinking at all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751105
    m_Localized: Just to sit and do nothing all day... what a life!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751106
    m_Localized: Icelings are helpful during summer days, keeping your drinks cool!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751107
    m_Localized: "We use Iceling\u2019s pit as a refrigerator for our food. Ingenious
      design!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751108
    m_Localized: Icelings are shy and tend to keep to their lair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751109
    m_Localized: This Pinequeak is focused on tearing this dummy to pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751110
    m_Localized: I wonder if he is so committed to training or just mad at something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751111
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m glad I\u2019m not on the receiving end of those little
      fists."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751112
    m_Localized: Pinequeak, mad as ever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751113
    m_Localized: Prowlers are responsible for carrying letters between villages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751114
    m_Localized: Someone got a letter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751115
    m_Localized: I should write to my aunt in another village to see if they are
      ok.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751125
    m_Localized: "Frogmar\u2019s fiery breath is powering the Hatchery. The eggs
      have it nice and comfy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751126
    m_Localized: This Frogmar is very careful with its breath. You can see it takes
      its job very seriously!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751127
    m_Localized: I wish I had a Frogmar to heat my bath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751128
    m_Localized: Everybody does something for the village. This Frogmar is making
      sure a new generation of Mystlings will hatch healthy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751132
    m_Localized: I was a Tamer like you, but then... I heard it somewhere before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751133
    m_Localized: I wake up at 4 AM, exercise, eat breakfast and start training. I
      wish I had friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751134
    m_Localized: See that Pinequeak over there? With such dedication, you can achieve
      anything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751135
    m_Localized: Train hard, so we can have a chance against the Eclipse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751136
    m_Localized: Hungry? We have the best cuisine this side of the mountains!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751137
    m_Localized: "You are way too skinny! Come, I\u2019ll get you something tasty."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751138
    m_Localized: Check out our daily special!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751139
    m_Localized: Great food and even better company!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751118
    m_Localized: I've seen Eftus fish here for weeks but all I've seen him catch
      are boots and cans. Maybe he's started a collection...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751116
    m_Localized: Look at him, just fishing all day long. Sounds like a peaceful life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751117
    m_Localized: He's caught a fish! Now I'm starting to get hungry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523639820288
    m_Localized: Any more mail to deliver? These Prowlers will be setting off soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791808
    m_Localized: I wish Prowlers could talk. They must have heard tons of juicy gossip
      on their travels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791809
    m_Localized: Prowlers are valued workers and get paid in coin like everyone else.
      I wonder what they spend it on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751119
    m_Localized: Oh to be a Fale, splashing and looking cute all day long...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751120
    m_Localized: Don't be fooled by their cuteness - Fales' teeth are as sharp as
      needles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751121
    m_Localized: Fale's tongue always seems to be out. Maybe it uses it as a paddle
      when it swims?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751122
    m_Localized: This Bolb seems to be having a one-man party. Wish I was invited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751123
    m_Localized: Bolbs can blend into most environments very easily. If you see them
      come out of hiding they must have taken a liking to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 328104751124
    m_Localized: I knew Bolbs weren't lazy - they are just saving energy for a dance
      recital!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791810
    m_Localized: Feeling watched in the woods? It's probably just a Bolb making sure
      you mean no harm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791811
    m_Localized: You are very talented, young tamer. Wisdom and skill will come with
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791812
    m_Localized: To know the challenge is great and still take it on - that is true
      courage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 10483523660791813
    m_Localized: Ah! It's almost time for my pre-dinner nap. It's been an hour since
      my post-lunch one...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794981822464
    m_Localized: Go ahead, help yourself to a little treat for your Mystlings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794994405376
    m_Localized: Good to see you, tamer! Grab something for the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794994405377
    m_Localized: Ah! You've come just in time. Here, I've made these just for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794994405378
    m_Localized: Feast well and journey far!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794994405379
    m_Localized: Come back when you want seconds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
  - m_Id: 18157794994405380
    m_Localized: Safe travels, Tamer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 2105433060097654784
